{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "KSBL Quiz Platform",
    "description": "Full API test suite for the KSBL AI-powered quiz platform.\n\nOur server: http://localhost:8080\nAI server:  https://ksbl-ai.vercel.app\n\nAI quiz generation is a 2-step internal process:\n  1. POST /v1/ingestions          → returns x-quiz-id\n  2. GET  /v1/quizzes/{id}/review-export  → returns questions\nBoth steps run inside our server. Frontend only calls /api/quiz.\n\nRecommended test order:\n1. Register Teacher  →  Login Teacher  (teacher_token auto-saved)\n2. Add Student       →  Login Student  (student_token auto-saved)\n3. Create Quiz (upload PDF or pass url field)  →  quiz_id auto-saved\n4. Set Question Marks  →  Publish Quiz\n5. Student: Get Available Quizzes  →  Submit Attempt\n6. Teacher: Get Quiz Results",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacher_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "quiz_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Teacher",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ali Hassan\",\n  \"email\": \"teacher@ksbl.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"Teacher@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Teacher",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('teacher_token', res.data.token);",
                  "  console.log('teacher_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"teacher@ksbl.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"Teacher@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Student",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('student_token', res.data.token);",
                  "  console.log('student_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@ksbl.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"Student@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Users (Teacher)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add Student",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/students", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "students"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sara Khan\",\n  \"email\": \"student@ksbl.edu\",\n  \"password\": \"Student@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Students",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/students", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "students"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Quiz (Teacher)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Quiz",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data._id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('quiz_id', res.data._id);",
                  "  console.log('quiz_id saved:', res.data._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "quiz"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "classId",               "value": "class_001",                              "type": "text" },
                { "key": "topicName",              "value": "Introduction to Machine Learning",        "type": "text" },
                { "key": "expiresAt",              "value": "2026-06-01T23:59:00.000Z",               "type": "text" },
                { "key": "questionCount",          "value": "5",                                      "type": "text" },
                { "key": "marksType",              "value": "equal",                                  "type": "text" },
                { "key": "equalMarksPerQuestion",  "value": "10",                                     "type": "text" },
                { "key": "complexityLevel",        "value": "medium",                                 "type": "text" },
                { "key": "maxAttempts",            "value": "2",                                      "type": "text" },
                { "key": "file",                   "type": "file", "src": [],
                  "description": "Select a PDF file from your computer" },
                { "key": "url",                    "value": "",   "type": "text",
                  "description": "PDF URL — use this instead of file if you have a hosted PDF", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Question Marks",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/{{quiz_id}}/marks",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}", "marks"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"marks\": [\n    { \"questionIndex\": 0, \"marks\": 10 },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 1, \"marks\": 10 },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 2, \"marks\": 10 },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 3, \"marks\": 10 },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 4, \"marks\": 10 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Publish Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/{{quiz_id}}/publish",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}", "publish"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Quizzes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "quiz"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz By ID (Teacher View)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/{{quiz_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Attempts (Student)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Available Quizzes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{student_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/attempts/available", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "attempts", "available"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz By ID (Student View — no correctAnswer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{student_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/{{quiz_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit Attempt",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{student_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/attempts/quiz/{{quiz_id}}/attempt",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "attempts", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}", "attempt"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"answers\": [\n    { \"questionIndex\": 0, \"selectedAnswer\": \"Option A\" },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 1, \"selectedAnswer\": \"Option B\" },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 2, \"selectedAnswer\": \"Option C\" },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 3, \"selectedAnswer\": \"Option A\" },\n    { \"questionIndex\": 4, \"selectedAnswer\": \"Option D\" }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Attempts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{student_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/attempts/quiz/{{quiz_id}}/attempts",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "attempts", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}", "attempts"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Results (Teacher)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz Results",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{teacher_token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/attempts/quiz/{{quiz_id}}/results",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "attempts", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}", "results"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
